  The app listens for the wake word with openWakeWord (https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord, code Apache-2.0).
  Its pre-trained models (melspectrogram.onnx, embedding_model.onnx, hey_jarvis_v0.1.onnx) are licensed
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial, share-alike). They are therefore not shipped here:
  scripts/fetch-wake-models.sh downloads them from the openWakeWord v0.5.1 release into
  android/app/src/main/assets/wake/. A build that contains them may only be used non-commercially and must
  keep this attribution. embedding_model.onnx derives from Google's speech_embedding model.

